  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent: 1) cr&#xe9;ation et promotion d&apos;un organisme de surveillance du Trait&#xe9; sur la non-prolif&#xe9;ration des armes nucl&#xe9;aires qui analyse la mani&#xe8;re dont les &#xc9;tats parties au Trait&#xe9; ont mis en &#x153;uvre leurs obligations et engagements; 2) &#xe9;tablissement et promotion d&apos;un indice de transparence nucl&#xe9;aire qui analyse les donn&#xe9;es sur le niveau de transparence des pays qui poss&#xe8;dent des armes nucl&#xe9;aires et produit une marque qui permet de faire des comparaisons et de suivre les tendances.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) produced and promoted a &quot;Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty Monitor&quot; that analyzes how States Parties to the Nuclear Non-Proliferation Treaty have implemented their obligations and commitments; and (2) produced and promoted a &quot;Nuclear Transparency Index&quot; that  analyzes data on the level of transparency by countries that possess nuclear weapons and produce a score that permits comparison and tracking trends.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
